From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WinTone01 <mertbayinma792@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 05:27:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Parallel sensor phase

Adapted from DivineMC (NONPLAYT, GPL-3.0). Mob sensors that are due this
tick and were checked to only read the world run on worker threads
before entities tick, while the world's tick thread waits. Targeting
conditions become thread-local, sensor threads use their own sorter
(Leaf's per-world FastBitRadixSort is not thread-safe) and the sensor
timer is set so the vanilla interval is kept.

